→ "I completely understand. Think of me as your first line of support - I handle the routine questions instantly so your team can focus on the meaningful conversations that need a human touch. Your customers get immediate answers, and your staff isn't overwhelmed with repetitive calls."
"This seems expensive"
→ "I understand cost is important. Compare it to hiring: €300-800 monthly versus €2,000+ for even a part-time receptionist. Plus I work nights, weekends, holidays, and never call in sick. Most clients see ROI within the first few months from captured leads alone."
